UPDATE companies SET description='ACE Medical Inc was founded in 2001 in Honolulu, Hawaii, as a family-owned and locally operated durable medical equipment provider. The business was established to serve the islands'' home healthcare needs and has remained under family ownership since its inception.

The company supplies a broad range of home healthcare equipment, including mobility aids, walking aids, oxygen systems, CPAP and BiPAP machines, bathroom safety equipment, and medical beds. In addition to sales, ACE Medical offers rental options for many of its products, catering to both short-term and long-term needs. The firm serves individual patients as well as healthcare facilities across Hawaii and overseas, drawing on over 25 years of experience in the region.

ACE Medical primarily serves the home healthcare and durable medical equipment sectors. Its customer base includes elderly patients seeking mobility and respiratory support, as well as hospitals, clinics, and long-term care facilities in Hawaii and international markets that require reliable medical supplies. The company emphasizes a community-oriented approach, referring to its customers as ''ohana'' (family).

The company differentiates itself through its family-owned, locally rooted model and a senior discount of 5–10% on Tuesdays. It highlights personalized customer service and long-standing local experience as key reasons customers choose ACE Medical over larger national chains.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Durable medical equipment sales", "Equipment rental", "Home healthcare equipment distribution", "Customer support and service"], "industries": ["Home medical equipment", "Durable medical equipment", "Healthcare"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and locally operated", "Senior discount 5\u201310% off on Tuesdays", "Over 25 years of experience serving Hawaii and overseas", "Equipment rental options available"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2001 -> db", "Headquartered in Honolulu, Hawaii -> db", "Family-owned and locally operated -> page /", "Provides durable medical equipment including mobility aids, walking aids, oxygen, CPAP/BiPAP, bathroom equipment, medical beds -> page /", "Offers equipment rentals -> page /", "Serves patients and healthcare facilities in Hawaii and overseas -> page /", "Over 25 years of experience -> page /", "Senior discount 5-10% off on Tuesdays -> page /", "Brands carried (unspecified) -> page /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We provide several categories of quality home medical equipment such as mobility, walking aids, oxygen, CPAP/BIPAP, bathroom equipment, medical beds, and more.", "founded_year": "2001", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='ace-medical-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='ACI Plastics Inc was founded in 1967 in North Little Rock, Arkansas. The company began as a source for plastic supply and fabrication and has since grown to operate four production facilities centrally located in the United States.

The company provides custom plastic fabrication services including laser cutting, CNC routing, and thermoforming (vacuum, pressure, and drape forming) for prototype and large-run production. It works with engineered plastics such as UHMW, nylon, acetal, PTFE, PVC, phenolic, and HDPE, as well as transparent, UV-resistant, and graphic-grade materials. Additional capabilities include screen printing, die cutting, vinyl lettering, and assembly.

Its product lines range from ballot boxes and sign holders to slatwall displays, risers, and food displays, and it supplied COVID-19 barriers for schools, restaurants, and medical settings.

