UPDATE companies SET description='ACI Plastics South, LLC runs a post-industrial plastics reprocessing plant in Liberty, South Carolina. The company focuses on converting plastic scrap into reusable resins and compounds for automotive and industrial supply chains.

The facility provides size reduction, multi-layer separation, electrostatic and density separation, fiber and optical sorting, patented paint removal, compounding on twin- and single-screw extruders, blending, pelletizing, and full logistics. Annual capacities include 70 million pounds of size reduction, 35 million pounds of separation, 10 million pounds of paint removal, and 40 million pounds of compounding. Equipment includes nine grinders, two shredders, two multi-layer separators, an electrostatic separator, a density separator, a fiber separator, an optical sorter, six paint-removal tanks, three twin-screw extruders, one single-screw extruder, multiple ribbon and paddle blenders, and a dedicated fleet of five tractors with 20 box trailers and two bulk trailers.

Primary customers are automotive manufacturers and tier suppliers generating multi-layer instrument panels, door panels, and painted TPO, PP, ABS, and PC/ABS parts. The company also serves broader post-industrial plastic waste streams, offering closed-loop programs that return reprocessed pellets or certified compounds to the original molder.

ACI Plastics differentiates itself with a patented paint-removal process that meets Class A surface requirements, a commercialized multi-layer separation technology achieving over 99.98% purity, an A2LA-accredited lab certified to ISO 17025:2017, and a logistics operation that handles pickup and delivery. The firm states its closed-loop model reduces material cost below virgin resin pricing.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 17025:2017 (Flint location only)','A2LA accreditation']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Size reduction (shredding, grinding)", "Plastic separation (multi-layer, electrostatic, density, fiber, optical)", "Paint removal (patented process)", "Compounding (twin-screw, single-screw)", "Blending (ribbon, paddle, proportional)", "Pelletizing", "Logistics (pickup, delivery)", "Lab testing (ASTM/ISO mechanical and thermal properties)", "Closed-loop recycling programs"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Post-industrial plastics recycling", "Plastics manufacturing"], "materials": ["TPO", "PP", "ABS", "PC/ABS", "Multi-layer automotive instrument panels (substrate, foam, skin)", "Rubber/plastic compounds", "Virgin compounds"], "equipment": ["9 grinders", "1 wet grinder", "2 shredders", "All metal separators", "Fine separation system", "2 multi-layer separators", "1 electrostatic separator", "1 density separator", "1 fiber separator", "1 optical sorter", "6 paint removal tanks", "3 twin-screw extruders", "1 single-screw extruder", "15,000 lb ribbon blender", "4,000 lb ribbon blender", "2,000 lb ribbon blender", "1,000 lb ribbon blender", "300 lb paddle blender", "2 proportional blending systems", "5 tractors", "20 53'' box trailers", "2 bulk trailers"], "volume": "70M lbs/yr size reduction; 35M lbs/yr separation; 10M lbs/yr paint removal; 40M lbs/yr compounding", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Patented paint removal process for TPO, PP, ABS, and PC/ABS achieving Class A surface", "Multi-layer separation technology yielding >99.98% purity streams for automotive instrument panels", "A2LA-accredited lab with ISO 17025:2017 certification (Flint location)", "Full-service logistics with company-owned fleet of tractors and trailers", "Closed-loop recycling programs priced below virgin material cost"], "facts_used": ["Location: Liberty, South Carolina -> db", "Size reduction capacity: 70M lbs/yr -> /services", "Separation capacity: 35M lbs/yr -> /services", "Paint removal capacity: 10M lbs/yr -> /services", "Compounding capacity: 40M lbs/yr -> /services", "Equipment list (grinders, shredders, separators, extruders, blenders, fleet) -> /services", "Patented paint removal for TPO, PP, ABS, PC/ABS -> /services", "Multi-layer separation >99.98% purity -> /services", "A2LA certified lab, ISO 17025:2017, ISO 9001:2015 (Flint) -> /quality", "Materials: TPO, PP, ABS, PC/ABS, multi-layer automotive IPs -> /services", "Industries: automotive instrument panels, door panels -> /services", "Closed-loop recycling, logistics fleet -> /services", "Pelletizing and compounding services -> /services"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We can pelletize your material, taking it to a greater value using our twin screw or single screw extruders", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='aci-plastics-south-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
