UPDATE companies SET description='ACTIA Electronics operates from Romulus, Michigan, as the North American electronics manufacturing arm of the international ACTIA Group. The facility serves as a dedicated site for electronic production targeting the North American market, providing Tier 1 and Tier 2 solutions for automotive and industrial sectors with high standards of quality and compliance.

The company delivers full lifecycle EMS solutions, spanning engineering validation, new product introduction, volume production, and aftermarket support. Core processes include PCB assembly (PCBA), box build assembly, mechanical and subsystem assembly, conformal coating, and supply chain management. Programs are characterized as high-mix, mid-volume, with an emphasis on traceability, precision, and speed.

ACTIA Electronics serves OEMs and Tier 1/Tier 2 suppliers across automotive, rail, aerospace, industrial, IoT, and energy sectors. The company highlights expertise in connected devices for home automation and power electronics, as well as aerospace solutions leveraging automotive-grade quality systems.

Differentiators cited by the company include IPC-A-610 certified inspection expertise with an internal trainer, proactive supply chain and production planning, PPAP support, and quality system alignment. The site maintains ISO 9001, ISO 14001, IATF 16949, RoHS, and ISO 27001 certifications, reflecting a focus on quality, environmental management, automotive standards, and information security.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 14001','IATF 16949','RoHS','ISO 27001','IPC-A-610']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB Assembly (PCBA)", "Box Build Assembly", "Mechanical Assembly", "Subsystem Assembly", "Conformal Coating", "Supply Chain Management", "Design & Engineering", "New Product Introduction (NPI)", "Engineering Validation", "Aftermarket Support", "IPC-A-610 Inspection", "PPAP Support", "Quality System Alignment", "Proactive Production Planning", "Cybersecurity (ISO 27001)", "Sustainability Initiatives", "Industry 4.0 Integration"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Rail", "Aerospace", "Industrial", "IoT", "Energy"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "High-mix / mid-volume", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Full lifecycle EMS from engineering validation through aftermarket support", "High-mix / mid-volume production with traceability and speed", "IPC-A-610 certified inspection with internal trainer", "Proactive supply chain and production planning", "ISO 27001 certified information security management since 2018"], "facts_used": ["Location: Romulus, Michigan -> db", "North American electronics manufacturing arm of ACTIA Group -> pages \"/\"", "Provides Tier 1 and Tier 2 solutions for automotive and industrial sectors -> pages \"/\"", "Full lifecycle EMS solutions: engineering validation, NPI, volume production, aftermarket support -> pages \"/\"", "Core processes: PCB assembly, box build, mechanical assembly, subsystem assembly, conformal coating -> db capabilities and products", "High-mix / mid-volume programs with traceability, pre