UPDATE companies SET description='AEC Enterprises operates from New Virginia, Iowa. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure in the provided materials. It presents itself as a specialized engineering and manufacturing firm with a long-standing reputation in seed production equipment.

The firm unifies custom metal fabrication, precision machining (both CNC and manual milling and turning), welding, industrial painting, and mechanical assembly under one roof. It also builds UL 508A-certified control panels and designs robotic cells and complete automation systems. AEC produces its own line of seed processing machinery—including production shellers, precleaners, batch shellers, sizers, integrated fan/burner units, and conveying infrastructure—and accepts contract manufacturing work ranging from one-off components to full-scale integrated production lines.

Its customer base spans the seed and agricultural sectors, serving commercial production facilities and foundation seed laboratories, as well as automotive and specialized manufacturing industries that require custom automation, control panels, and robotic integration.

AEC emphasizes a single point of accountability by combining fabrication, machining, and control-panel building in-house. The company cites an execution-first approach focused on longevity and maintainability, end-to-end support from design through field startup, and the ability to scale from prototypes to recurring production runs as its core differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['UL 508A']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal fabrication", "Precision CNC machining (milling and turning)", "Manual machining (milling and turning)", "Welding", "Industrial painting", "Mechanical assembly", "UL 508A control panel building", "Robotic cell design and integration", "Custom control panel design", "System integration", "Automation engineering", "Seed processing equipment design and manufacturing", "Contract manufacturing (prototype to production)"], "industries": ["Seed production", "Agricultural", "Automotive", "Specialized manufacturing", "Foundation seed laboratories", "Commercial production facilities"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "One-off custom components to full-scale integrated production lines", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["UL 508A-certified control panel building in-house", "Single-point accountability across fabrication, machining, and controls", "End-to-end support from design to field startup", "Scalable production from one-off prototypes to full-scale lines", "Execution-first approach targeting longevity and maintainability"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in New Virginia, Iowa -> db", "Unifies custom metal fabrication, precision machining (CNC and manual), and UL508A-certified control panel building -> /about-us", "Designs and manufactures seed production equipment: production shellers, precleaners, batch shellers, sizers, integrated fan/burner units, conveying infrastructure -> /", "Provides manufacturing services: fabrication, machine shop, welding, industrial paint, mechanical assembly -> /", "Offers automa