UPDATE companies SET description='ALPLA, headquartered in Salt Lake City, Utah, is a family-owned plastic packaging manufacturer with a history spanning over 70 years. The company operates 17 high-capacity plants across the United States, including facilities in Jefferson City, Missouri, and Bowling Green, Kentucky, and more than 200 sites globally.

The company produces custom and standardized bottles, closures, and containers for home care, personal care, and industrial applications. Its capabilities include injection molding, large-volume bottle production with dual-neck options, decoration services for private-label and white-label packaging, and in-house testing for sealing, filling, and stacking performance. Plants are equipped for efficient mold and color changeovers, supporting flexible capacities from small runs to large-scale orders.

ALPLA serves brands in home care, personal care, and industrial sectors that require sustainable packaging solutions such as PET, HDPE, rPET, and post-consumer resin (PCR). Customers include companies seeking to localize supply chains, reduce transportation emissions, and accelerate time-to-market through standard designs that eliminate development delays.

The company emphasizes its family-owned heritage, quality and service excellence, and a localized production model that leverages a global network of over 200 facilities. It offers a CO2 reduction calculator to quantify environmental benefits and positions its standard packaging as ready-to-fill, customizable through decoration, color, and closure choices.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection Molding", "Large Volume Bottle Production", "Dual-neck Bottle Capabilities", "Bottle Decoration", "Custom Packaging Design", "Standardized Packaging", "In-house Testing (Sealing, Filling, Stacking)", "Private Label Packaging", "White-label Packaging", "Sustainable Material Processing (PCR, rPET)"], "industries": ["Home Care", "Personal Care", "Industrial Applications", "Private Label", "White-label"], "materials": ["PET", "HDPE", "rPET", "PCR (Post-Consumer Resin)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned with 70+ years of packaging innovation", "17 high-capacity U.S. plants and 200+ global facilities", "Standard designs eliminate development delays", "In-house testing for sealing, filling, and stacking performance", "CO2 reduction calculator for sustainable packaging decisions"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Salt Lake City, Utah -> db", "Family-owned, 70+ years history -> /", "17 U.S. plants, 200+ global facilities -> /", "Locations: Jefferson City, MO; Bowling Green, KY -> /", "Products: custom/standard bottles, closures, containers -> /", "Processes: injection molding, large volume bottles, dual-neck, decoration, in-house testing -> /, capabilities", "Materials: PET, HDPE, rPET, PCR -> /", "Industries: home care, personal care, industrial, private label, white-label -> /, description, capabilities", "Differentiators: standard designs, flexible capacity, CO2 calculator, localized production -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "ALPLA''s 17 hig