UPDATE companies SET description='ALTTRIX Corporation is based in New York, New York. The company''s founding year, ownership structure, and founders are not disclosed in publicly available sources.

The firm provides artificial intelligence consulting and implementation services. Its offerings span generative AI, machine learning model development, blockchain integration, data governance, cloud solution design, and vulnerability assessment with AI-driven threat prevention. The company describes a four-step methodology: identifying business problems, gathering and analyzing data, developing appropriate AI models, and integrating and monitoring the solution.

