UPDATE companies SET description='AZ CAP Co, based in Prescott Valley, Arizona, traces its roots to 1999 when Arizona Cap & Apparel began as a small embroidery operation. The business was later taken over by Eva Janckila and Vance, who expanded its capabilities beyond embroidery into a full-service branding partner for apparel, promotional products, and print.

